Privacy Policy for PureVerse

Effective Date: [January 24,2026]

PureVerse respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the PureVerse mobile application (“App”).

1. Information We Collect

PureVerse does not collect, store, or process any personal information from its users.

Specifically, the App:

Does not collect personal data (such as name, email, or phone number)

Does not collect location data

Does not require user accounts or login

Does not track user activity

Does not use cookies or analytics tools

2. Image Generation and Sharing

PureVerse allows users to generate Bible verse images and share them on social media platforms.

All image generation happens locally within the App.

When you choose to share an image, the sharing action is handled by the social media app or platform you select.

PureVerse does not access, store, or transmit shared content after it leaves the App.

Please review the privacy policies of third-party platforms (e.g., Facebook, Instagram) for how they handle shared content.

3. Third-Party Services

PureVerse does not integrate with third-party analytics, advertising, or data-collection services.

4. Children’s Privacy

PureVerse is safe for all ages and does not knowingly collect any personal information from children or any other users.

5. Data Security

Since PureVerse does not collect or store user data, there is no personal data at risk of being stored or breached.

6. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated effective date.

